                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi'>Active Customers – Customers who have placed more than one successful dmart order within a given month.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi'>Inactive Customers – Customers who have not placed any dmart orders in the current month but made at least one order in the past two months.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans SemiDemi'>Churned Customers – Customers who have not placed any dmart orders in the current or previous two months.</run>
